# Intentional Exclusions:
# 1. Binary uploads and user-generated media files
public/uploads/

# 2. EJS templates: Prettier's HTML parser corrupts embedded scriptlets (<% ... %>) and attribute conditionals
*.ejs

# 3. CSS stylesheets: public/css/*.css contains legacy stylesheets. Excluded to prevent reformatting
#    unrelated styling rules (rgba spacing, shorthand properties) and avoid unnecessary diff churn.
public/css/

# 4. Client-side browser JavaScript: Excluded to prevent reformatting legacy frontend scripts
public/js/
